      <div type="clause" n="2">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:Wif">Wif</ref> 2</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">Æfter ðam is witanne, hwam ðæt fosterlean gebyrige; weddige se brydguma eft þæs; 7 hit aborgian his frynd.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">Next, it must be known to whom belongs the remuneration for rearing her. The bridegroom is then to pledge this, and his friends are to stand surety for it.</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">Æfter ðam is to witanne, hwam þæt fosterlean gebyrige; weddige se brydguma eft ðes; 7 hit aborgian his frynd.</ab>
      </div>
